- Authoritative clean worktree為`G:\PulseTrade.worktrees\20260710-ptcs-cleanup\dynamic` branch `20260710_027.ptcs_dynamic_beta79_alignment`。
- 既有untracked `.pcsl/dynamic-beta72-build-*`是保留的generated evidence，不修改/刪除/提交。

